  "title": "Lua: Use tvb_strsize_enc in TvbRange:strsize",
  "description": "We have a function that handles the encoding, use that instead of\nre-inventing the encoding handling. Exceptions work better in Lua\nnow, so use them instead of trying to guess.\n\nWe catch the relevant exceptions and convert them to Lua errors, which\nalso adds the Lua traceback to the tree. (The fix for #20767 means that\nexception handling should not be dangerous with nested Lua anymore, but\nthe Lua traceback is nicer.)\n\nIt still doesn't really make sense that this function takes a TvbRange\nbut can search outside that range for the string null terminator, but\nthis is how this has always worked.",
